Supplementary Figure 3: Data Cleaning and Preparation Steps\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Supplementary Figure 3 presents joinpoint regression analysis of monthly overdose decedent donor (ODD)-associated transplant rates (January 2015\'96December 2024) for simultaneous pancreas-kidney (SPK) transplants (panel A) and simultaneous liver-kidney (SLK) transplants (panel B). Crude rates are calculated per US resident population using the NCI Joinpoint Regression Program Version 5.4 (detailed settings in manuscript Methods section).\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

